    "ranking_note": "Presentation ranking may use medication exposure, temporal relation to starting or continuing a plausible drug, fever during continued exposure, relative bradycardia or otherwise discordant clinical wellness, rash/eosinophilia/organ injury being absent when directly observed, and ordinary labs available at that clinical stage. Dechallenge, rechallenge, final adjudication, negative cultures, and fever resolution after stopping the drug are confirmatory/non-ranking unless a post-workup test explicitly includes them."
